      <title>GoPro从病毒式爆红相机沦为智能手机普及的受害者</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/ai/post/20260902/GoPro%E4%BB%8E%E7%97%85%E6%AF%92%E5%BC%8F%E7%88%86%E7%BA%A2%E7%9B%B8%E6%9C%BA%E6%B2%A6%E4%B8%BA%E6%99%BA%E8%83%BD%E6%89%8B%E6%9C%BA%E6%99%AE%E5%8F%8A%E7%9A%84%E5%8F%97%E5%AE%B3%E8%80%85/</link>
